just put it in recently to save some turns; just to see if I saw less
hunger.  I haven't had bad things happen to me as a result so haven't seen
the need to restrain it.  I am just kind of surprised that the response to
my post wasn't people just laughing and telling similar stories of their
own.  Maybe I should have put a YASM in front of it?  I thought it was
funny, of all the things to be standing on when the game starts.  Would a
cockatrice corpse have gotten a different response?

